# scripts/pcgen-oracle-pin.env — the pinned PCGen oracle (public repo, never vendored).
# WHY: every corpus instrument resolves $PCGEN_CORPUS_ROOT (default $HOME/workspace/repos/pcgen/data)
# and until this file existed nothing pinned WHICH pcgen commit that was, so a cloud runner or a
# fresh box could sweep against a different oracle and report CLEAN. Bump deliberately: change the
# SHA here, re-run the full gate, and let corpus-sweep name every shipped record whose source moved.
PCGEN_ORACLE_REPO=https://github.com/PCGen/pcgen.git
PCGEN_ORACLE_SHA=7f818006e371188e5717fd18d74d18a420747fc6
PCGEN_ORACLE_SHA_DATE=2026-06-17            # informational: upstream commit date of the pin
# data/darwins_world_2/.../terrors_of_twisted_earth added for
# tests/sd17_b_races_and_abilities.rs::parser_runs_in_linear_time_on_representative_lst,
# which needs one real large-file fixture (~16 KB) to demonstrate O(n)
# parsing; a CI-fetched sparse checkout without it panicked instead of
# skipping (CI runs 35050389421, 35045137495 -- see the oracle-fetch step in
# .github/workflows/*.yml).
# data/starfinder + system/gameModes/Starfinder added for SD-37 (Starfinder 1e): the SF converter,
# the SF game mode loader and the SF oracle harness read them. fetch-pcgen-oracle.sh probes both
# (the Core Rulebook .pcc and the game-mode dir) whenever they appear in this list.
# data/_universal added because the SF Core Rulebook .pcc carries RACE:*/_universal/races.lst,
# which resolves to data/_universal/races.lst -- outside the cone above. The sparse CI checkout
# lacked it and crates/codex-ingest/tests/sf_core_proof.rs failed 8 tests (CI runs 38475972609,
# 39011422319); hermes has a full clone, so nobody saw it locally. PF .pcc files also reference
# _universal/races.lst and _universal/datacontrols_no_align.lst. fetch-pcgen-oracle.sh probes it.
# code/testsuite/PCGfiles added because crates/codex-ingest/tests/sf_mapping_table.rs reads PCGen's own
# sf_soldier.pcg / sf_mechanic.pcg from it, and the runner tests read pf_Paladin.pcg. Cone mode also
# brings code/testsuite/base-xml.ftl; the engine-running tests skip on tests/common/mod.rs
# pcgen_engine_runnable (gradlew + wrapper jar + code/src/java + template + java), not on that file.
PCGEN_ORACLE_SPARSE_PATHS="data/pathfinder system/gameModes/Pathfinder data/starfinder system/gameModes/Starfinder data/darwins_world_2/rpg_objects/darwins_world_2/terrors_of_twisted_earth data/_universal code/testsuite/PCGfiles"
